* LP87524J-Q1 behavioral model (timing / sequencing / supervision only)
*
* Built from SNVSAW2B (datasheet) and SNVU663A Table 3-8..3-10 (J-variant OTP).
* NOT a switching model: each buck is an ideal current-limited regulator that
* injects current straight into its output node. Use it for start-up order,
* PGOOD / GPIO2 reset timing, shutdown, UVLO and OVP-latch behaviour.
*
* Modelled (J OTP):
*   Buck0 3.30 V  start 5 ms  stop 0 ms   ILIM 2.5 A
*   Buck1 1.20 V  start 5 ms  stop 0 ms   ILIM 2.5 A
*   Buck2 1.00 V  start 2 ms  stop 0 ms   ILIM 5 A
*   Buck3 1.80 V  start 0 ms  stop 1 ms   ILIM 3.5 A
*   slew 3.8 mV/us, 230 ohm discharge when off (active while VANA > 1.2 V)
*   GPIO2: open drain, follows EN1, release 5 ms after EN1 rises, 0 ms on fall
*   PGOOD: open drain, window -40/+50 mV (typ), 7 us invalid filter,
*          11 ms valid debounce, disabled bucks ignored, ramping bucks = invalid
*   UVLO 2.63 V rising / 2.60 V falling, OVP 5.8 V typ (param), 20 us debounce,
*   OVP is LATCHED (interrupt can only be cleared over I2C, none on this board)
*   EN1 threshold 0.8 V (between VIL 0.4 / VIH 1.2), 500 k internal pulldown
*
* Unknown / assumed (params):
*   totp   time from VANA>UVLO to READ OTP done (default 1 ms, not in datasheet)
*   rdis   1 = discharge resistors active (EN_RDISx default 1 per register map)
*   ovp    OVP rising threshold (5.6 min, 5.8 typ, 6.1 max)
*   uvwin/ovwin PGOOD window

.subckt LP87524J vana en1 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 out0 out1 out2 out3 gpio2 pgood
+ params: totp=1m rdis=1 ovp=5.8 uvwin=0.040 ovwin=0.050 pgdly=11m

Ren1 en1 0 500k

* ---- supply supervision ----------------------------------------------------
* UVLO with hysteresis (latch node uv: 1 = above UVLO)
Cuv uv 0 1
Buv 0 uv I = (V(vana) > 2.63 ? 1e6*(1-V(uv)) : 0) - (V(vana) < 2.60 ? 1e6*V(uv) : 0)
* OVP debounced 20 us then latched until UVLO
Covd ovd 0 1
Bovd 0 ovd I = (V(vana) > {ovp} ? 1 : -1e6*V(ovd))
Col ol 0 1
Bol 0 ol I = (V(ovd) > 20u ? 1e6*(1-V(ol)) : 0) - (V(uv) < 0.5 ? 1e6*V(ol) : 0)
* OTP read timer
Cto to 0 1
Bto 0 to I = (V(uv) > 0.5 ? 1 : -1e6*V(to))
Bready ready_r 0 V = (V(uv) > 0.5 && V(to) > {totp}) ? 1 : 0
Rreadyf ready_r ready 1k
Creadyf ready 0 1n

* ---- enable and its timers ------------------------------------------------------
* EN1 3 us debounce
Cend end 0 1
Bend 0 end I = (V(en1) > 0.8 ? 1 : -1e6*V(end))
Ben en_r 0 V = (V(ready) > 0.5 && V(end) > 3u && V(ol) < 0.5) ? 1 : 0
Renf en_r en 1k
Cenf en 0 1n
* time since en rose
Cton ton 0 1
Bton 0 ton I = (V(en) > 0.5 ? 1 : -1e6*V(ton))
* time since en fell
Ctof tof 0 1
Btof 0 tof I = (V(en) < 0.5 ? 1 : -1e6*V(tof))

* buck on-states (shutdown delay 0 for 0/1/2, 1 ms for 3; UVLO/OVP = immediate off)
Bon0 on0_r 0 V = (V(en) > 0.5 && V(ton) > 5m) ? 1 : 0
Ron0f on0_r on0 1k
Con0f on0 0 1n
Bon1 on1_r 0 V = (V(en) > 0.5 && V(ton) > 5m) ? 1 : 0
Ron1f on1_r on1 1k
Con1f on1 0 1n
Bon2 on2_r 0 V = (V(en) > 0.5 && V(ton) > 2m) ? 1 : 0
Ron2f on2_r on2 1k
Con2f on2 0 1n
Con3 on3 0 1
Bon3 0 on3 I = (V(en) > 0.5 ? 1e6*(1-V(on3)) : 0) - ((V(tof) > 1m || V(ready) < 0.5 || V(ol) > 0.5) ? 1e6*V(on3) : 0)

* ---- soft-start reference ramps (3.8 mV/us) ----------------------------------
Cr0 r0 0 1
Br0 0 r0 I = V(on0) > 0.5 ? 3.8e3*max(0, min(1, (3.30-V(r0))/0.005)) : -1e6*V(r0)
Cr1 r1 0 1
Br1 0 r1 I = V(on1) > 0.5 ? 3.8e3*max(0, min(1, (1.20-V(r1))/0.005)) : -1e6*V(r1)
Cr2 r2 0 1
Br2 0 r2 I = V(on2) > 0.5 ? 3.8e3*max(0, min(1, (1.00-V(r2))/0.005)) : -1e6*V(r2)
Cr3 r3 0 1
Br3 0 r3 I = V(on3) > 0.5 ? 3.8e3*max(0, min(1, (1.80-V(r3))/0.005)) : -1e6*V(r3)

* ---- power stages: current-limited transconductance, max duty = VIN-0.15 V ----
* The fast loop regulates the local output node; a slow (100 us) outer term adds the
* measured out->fb drop so the FB pin sits on target in DC (remote sense through the
* ferrite). Loop dynamics through the ferrite are studied in loadstep_1v0.cir instead.
Bdr0 dr0r 0 V = V(out0)-V(fb0)
Rdr0 dr0r dr0 100
Cdr0 dr0 0 1u
Bdr1 dr1r 0 V = V(out1)-V(fb1)
Rdr1 dr1r dr1 100
Cdr1 dr1 0 1u
Bdr2 dr2r 0 V = V(out2)-V(fb2)
Rdr2 dr2r dr2 100
Cdr2 dr2 0 1u
Bdr3 dr3r 0 V = V(out3)-V(fb3)
Rdr3 dr3r dr3 100
Cdr3 dr3 0 1u
Vs0 o0i out0 0
Bp0 0 o0i I = V(on0) > 0.5 ? max(-2.5, min(2.5, 200*(min(V(r0), V(vana)-0.15) + V(dr0) - V(out0)))) : 0
Vs1 o1i out1 0
Bp1 0 o1i I = V(on1) > 0.5 ? max(-2.5, min(2.5, 200*(min(V(r1), V(vana)-0.15) + V(dr1) - V(out1)))) : 0
Vs2 o2i out2 0
Bp2 0 o2i I = V(on2) > 0.5 ? max(-5.0, min(5.0, 200*(min(V(r2), V(vana)-0.15) + V(dr2) - V(out2)))) : 0
Vs3 o3i out3 0
Bp3 0 o3i I = V(on3) > 0.5 ? max(-3.5, min(3.5, 200*(min(V(r3), V(vana)-0.15) + V(dr3) - V(out3)))) : 0
* input current: output power / efficiency (85 %) drawn from VANA/VIN_Bx
Bin vana 0 I = (max(0,V(out0)*I(Vs0)) + max(0,V(out1)*I(Vs1)) + max(0,V(out2)*I(Vs2)) + max(0,V(out3)*I(Vs3))) / (0.85*max(V(vana), 1.0)) + 1m*min(1,V(vana)/3)
* discharge resistors
Bd0 out0 0 I = (V(on0) < 0.5 && V(vana) > 1.2 && {rdis} > 0.5) ? V(out0)/230 : 0
Bd1 out1 0 I = (V(on1) < 0.5 && V(vana) > 1.2 && {rdis} > 0.5) ? V(out1)/230 : 0
Bd2 out2 0 I = (V(on2) < 0.5 && V(vana) > 1.2 && {rdis} > 0.5) ? V(out2)/230 : 0
Bd3 out3 0 I = (V(on3) < 0.5 && V(vana) > 1.2 && {rdis} > 0.5) ? V(out3)/230 : 0

* ---- PGOOD ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* per buck: off -> ignored(1); ramping -> 0; settled -> window check
Bk0 k0_r 0 V = (1-V(on0)) + V(on0)*0.5*(1+tanh((V(r0)-(3.30-0.001))/2e-4))*0.5*(1+tanh((V(fb0)-(3.30-{uvwin}))/1e-3))*0.5*(1+tanh(((3.30+{ovwin})-V(fb0))/1e-3))
Rk0f k0_r k0 1k
Ck0f k0 0 1n
Bk1 k1_r 0 V = (1-V(on1)) + V(on1)*0.5*(1+tanh((V(r1)-(1.20-0.001))/2e-4))*0.5*(1+tanh((V(fb1)-(1.20-{uvwin}))/1e-3))*0.5*(1+tanh(((1.20+{ovwin})-V(fb1))/1e-3))
Rk1f k1_r k1 1k
Ck1f k1 0 1n
Bk2 k2_r 0 V = (1-V(on2)) + V(on2)*0.5*(1+tanh((V(r2)-(1.00-0.001))/2e-4))*0.5*(1+tanh((V(fb2)-(1.00-{uvwin}))/1e-3))*0.5*(1+tanh(((1.00+{ovwin})-V(fb2))/1e-3))
Rk2f k2_r k2 1k
Ck2f k2 0 1n
Bk3 k3_r 0 V = (1-V(on3)) + V(on3)*0.5*(1+tanh((V(r3)-(1.80-0.001))/2e-4))*0.5*(1+tanh((V(fb3)-(1.80-{uvwin}))/1e-3))*0.5*(1+tanh(((1.80+{ovwin})-V(fb3))/1e-3))
Rk3f k3_r k3 1k
Ck3f k3 0 1n
* time any monitor has been invalid (7 us filter)
Cbad bad 0 1
Bbad 0 bad I = (V(k0)*V(k1)*V(k2)*V(k3) < 0.5) ? 1 : -1e6*V(bad)
* PGOOD latch: low once invalid > 7 us; released after valid for pgdly
Cgd gd 0 1
Bgd 0 gd I = (V(k0)*V(k1)*V(k2)*V(k3) > 0.5 ? 1 : -1e9*V(gd))
Cpg pgs 0 1
Bpg 0 pgs I = (V(bad) > 7u ? -1e6*V(pgs) : 0) + (V(gd) > {pgdly} ? 1e6*(1-V(pgs)) : 0)
* open drain drivers (20 ohm on), only while VANA > 1.2 V and OTP loaded
Bpgood pgood 0 I = (V(ready) > 0.5 && V(pgs) < 0.5) ? V(pgood)/20 : 0
* GPIO2: low while en low or within 5 ms of en rising; low on OVP latch
Bgp2 gpio2 0 I = (V(ready) > 0.5 && (V(en) < 0.5 || V(ton) < 5m || V(ol) > 0.5)) ? V(gpio2)/20 : 0
.ends LP87524J
